1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:03,834
Every creator dreams of earning from YouTube.

2
00:00:03,834 --> 00:00:07,330
But how does the money reach your bank? The answer:

3
00:00:07,330 --> 00:00:08,358
Google AdSense.

4
00:00:09,608 --> 00:00:11,996
I'll show the whole process:

5
00:00:11,996 --> 00:00:14,726
applying to the Partner Program,

6
00:00:14,726 --> 00:00:16,176
creating AdSense,

7
00:00:16,176 --> 00:00:17,626
PIN verification,

8
00:00:17,626 --> 00:00:20,185
adding your bank and tax info.

9
00:00:21,085 --> 00:00:24,154
And I'll show where people go wrong,

10
00:00:24,154 --> 00:00:26,968
so your payment never gets stuck.

11
00:00:26,968 --> 00:00:27,991
Let's begin.

12
00:00:29,491 --> 00:00:29,916
First,

13
00:00:29,916 --> 00:00:31,332
how the money flows:

14
00:00:31,332 --> 00:00:33,881
YouTube shows ads on your videos and

15
00:00:33,881 --> 00:00:36,501
shares part of that revenue with you.

16
00:00:37,751 --> 00:00:40,155
It doesn't go straight to your bank.

17
00:00:40,155 --> 00:00:43,361
It collects in your AdSense for YouTube account,

18
00:00:43,361 --> 00:00:46,032
then gets sent to your bank every month.

19
00:00:47,282 --> 00:00:49,026
How big is your share?

20
00:00:49,026 --> 00:00:52,435
About 55% of the ad revenue on long videos,

21
00:00:52,435 --> 00:00:53,862
and 45% on Shorts.

22
00:00:55,112 --> 00:00:58,424
Earnings also depend on your topic and

23
00:00:58,424 --> 00:01:00,516
where your viewers are —

24
00:01:00,516 --> 00:01:03,566
so every channel earns differently.

25
00:01:04,816 --> 00:01:07,437
So don't treat AdSense as just a form —

26
00:01:07,437 --> 00:01:09,723
it's the locker for your earnings.

27
00:01:09,723 --> 00:01:12,075
Every detail in it must be correct.

28
00:01:13,575 --> 00:01:15,666
When should you set up AdSense?

29
00:01:15,666 --> 00:01:18,163
Once your channel is eligible for the

30
00:01:18,163 --> 00:01:20,187
YouTube Partner Program (YPP).

31
00:01:20,187 --> 00:01:21,401
In YouTube Studio,

32
00:01:21,401 --> 00:01:22,953
click Earn on the left.

33
00:01:25,653 --> 00:01:28,114
Here you can see your channel's progress.

34
00:01:28,114 --> 00:01:29,314
Under current rules,

35
00:01:29,314 --> 00:01:31,415
the Partner Program has two levels.

36
00:01:32,665 --> 00:01:33,360
Level 1:

37
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:34,750
500 subscribers,

38
00:01:34,750 --> 00:01:37,181
3 public uploads in 90 days,

39
00:01:37,181 --> 00:01:40,742
plus 3,000 watch hours in 12 months or 3M

40
00:01:40,742 --> 00:01:42,827
Shorts views in 90 days.

41
00:01:44,077 --> 00:01:46,921
This unlocks fan funding like memberships

42
00:01:46,921 --> 00:01:48,169
and Super Thanks —

43
00:01:48,169 --> 00:01:49,487
but not ad revenue.

44
00:01:50,737 --> 00:01:53,689
For ad revenue you need level 2:

45
00:01:53,689 --> 00:01:57,378
1,000 subscribers plus 4,000 watch hours

46
00:01:57,378 --> 00:01:58,578
in 12 months,

47
00:01:58,578 --> 00:02:01,437
or 10M Shorts views in 90 days.

48
00:02:02,687 --> 00:02:07,252
Only public long-form watch hours count —

49
00:02:07,252 --> 00:02:09,479
not Shorts, private,

50
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:12,485
unlisted or deleted videos.

51
00:02:13,735 --> 00:02:15,073
Not eligible yet?

52
00:02:15,073 --> 00:02:17,986
Click 'Get notified' on this page and

53
00:02:17,986 --> 00:02:20,820
YouTube will email you once you are.

54
00:02:22,070 --> 00:02:25,946
Watch hours and Shorts views don't add up —

55
00:02:25,946 --> 00:02:27,839
complete one of them.

56
00:02:27,839 --> 00:02:31,264
YouTube changes these rules over time,

57
00:02:31,264 --> 00:02:33,607
so always check in Studio.

58
00:02:35,107 --> 00:02:36,147
Before applying,

59
00:02:36,147 --> 00:02:37,838
make sure of three things.

60
00:02:38,838 --> 00:02:39,139
One:

61
00:02:39,139 --> 00:02:42,070
2-Step Verification must be on for your

62
00:02:42,070 --> 00:02:43,197
Google account.

63
00:02:44,447 --> 00:02:44,760
Two:

64
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:47,973
no active Community Guidelines strikes on

65
00:02:47,973 --> 00:02:48,992
your channel.

66
00:02:50,242 --> 00:02:50,851
Three,

67
00:02:50,851 --> 00:02:52,373
most important:

68
00:02:52,373 --> 00:02:54,098
original content.

69
00:02:54,098 --> 00:02:58,360
'Reused content' is the most common reason

70
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:00,592
channels get rejected.

71
00:03:02,092 --> 00:03:04,272
Reviewers look at your whole channel:

72
00:03:04,272 --> 00:03:05,155
its main theme,

73
00:03:05,155 --> 00:03:06,923
most-viewed and newest videos,

74
00:03:06,923 --> 00:03:08,808
and titles and descriptions too.

75
00:03:10,058 --> 00:03:11,548
So before applying,

76
00:03:11,548 --> 00:03:14,450
delete or make private any old copied

77
00:03:14,450 --> 00:03:16,646
videos or misleading titles.

78
00:03:18,146 --> 00:03:18,752
All set?

79
00:03:18,752 --> 00:03:19,661
Let's apply.

80
00:03:19,661 --> 00:03:22,614
Step one is the Partner Program terms —

81
00:03:22,614 --> 00:03:25,265
click START next to 'Review Partner

82
00:03:25,265 --> 00:03:26,401
Program terms'.

83
00:03:29,001 --> 00:03:32,147
They explain how revenue is shared and

84
00:03:32,147 --> 00:03:34,466
which rules you must follow.

85
00:03:34,466 --> 00:03:35,708
Read them once,

86
00:03:35,708 --> 00:03:37,198
then click Accept.

87
00:03:40,198 --> 00:03:41,186
Step two:

88
00:03:41,186 --> 00:03:44,698
Sign up for AdSense for YouTube.

89
00:03:44,698 --> 00:03:46,015
Click START.

90
00:03:48,815 --> 00:03:51,963
Now pick a Google account. A key rule:

91
00:03:51,963 --> 00:03:56,189
only one AdSense account is allowed per payee name.

92
00:03:57,439 --> 00:03:59,145
Already have AdSense,

93
00:03:59,145 --> 00:04:00,607
say for a website?

94
00:04:00,607 --> 00:04:02,557
Don't create a new one —

95
00:04:02,557 --> 00:04:06,456
choose that Gmail and link the existing account.

96
00:04:07,706 --> 00:04:08,876
I don't have one,

97
00:04:08,876 --> 00:04:11,217
so I'll pick my channel's account.

98
00:04:13,517 --> 00:04:16,195
Your channel is already filled in.

99
00:04:16,195 --> 00:04:18,479
Choose India as the country —

100
00:04:18,479 --> 00:04:20,527
it can't be changed later,

101
00:04:20,527 --> 00:04:21,630
so be careful.

102
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:26,562
Then accept the terms and click Continue.

103
00:04:29,062 --> 00:04:30,935
Now the payee information —

104
00:04:30,935 --> 00:04:32,670
details of who gets paid.

105
00:04:32,670 --> 00:04:35,167
Keep the account type as Individual.

106
00:04:36,417 --> 00:04:39,669
Type your name exactly as in your bank account —

107
00:04:39,669 --> 00:04:40,617
same spelling.

108
00:04:40,617 --> 00:04:43,124
A mismatch puts your payment on hold.

109
00:04:44,374 --> 00:04:48,020
Enter your full home address with PIN code —

110
00:04:48,020 --> 00:04:51,832
Google will mail a PIN letter to this address.

111
00:04:53,082 --> 00:04:54,415
If a phone number is asked,

112
00:04:54,415 --> 00:04:55,699
enter your active number —

113
00:04:55,699 --> 00:04:57,576
a verification code may be sent to it.

114
00:04:58,826 --> 00:05:00,381
Check everything once,

115
00:05:00,381 --> 00:05:01,653
then click Submit.

116
00:05:05,653 --> 00:05:07,760
AdSense is linked. Step three:

117
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:08,744
Get reviewed —

118
00:05:08,744 --> 00:05:11,624
YouTube's team will look at your channel.

119
00:05:12,874 --> 00:05:15,266
This usually takes about a month.

120
00:05:15,266 --> 00:05:18,600
Keep uploading and follow the rules meanwhile.

121
00:05:19,850 --> 00:05:23,346
You can track the review on this same Earn page —

122
00:05:23,346 --> 00:05:25,915
and YouTube emails you the decision.

123
00:05:27,165 --> 00:05:28,140
If rejected,

124
00:05:28,140 --> 00:05:29,115
don't panic:

125
00:05:29,115 --> 00:05:30,902
appeal within 21 days,

126
00:05:30,902 --> 00:05:34,965
or improve your content and reapply after 30 days.

127
00:05:36,215 --> 00:05:38,032
And once you're approved,

128
00:05:38,032 --> 00:05:39,195
you'll see this!

129
00:05:39,195 --> 00:05:41,448
Ads can now run on your videos.

130
00:05:43,548 --> 00:05:45,442
Next important step:

131
00:05:45,442 --> 00:05:47,052
PIN verification.

132
00:05:47,052 --> 00:05:49,419
Open AdSense for YouTube.

133
00:05:51,219 --> 00:05:54,715
Once your earnings pass a small threshold,

134
00:05:54,715 --> 00:05:58,294
Google posts a 6-digit PIN to your address.

135
00:05:58,294 --> 00:06:01,373
It usually takes 2–4 weeks to arrive.

136
00:06:02,623 --> 00:06:03,748
When it arrives,

137
00:06:03,748 --> 00:06:06,561
click Verify address and enter your PIN.

138
00:06:10,061 --> 00:06:10,635
Submit,

139
00:06:10,635 --> 00:06:13,011
and your address is verified.

140
00:06:13,011 --> 00:06:15,797
You get 4 months to enter the PIN;

141
00:06:15,797 --> 00:06:19,321
3 wrong tries can stop payments. No letter?

142
00:06:19,321 --> 00:06:21,697
Request a new PIN in AdSense.

143
00:06:22,947 --> 00:06:26,434
The PIN arrives as a plain letter from Google.

144
00:06:26,434 --> 00:06:28,025
Don't throw it away —

145
00:06:28,025 --> 00:06:30,830
many people mistake it for junk mail.

146
00:06:32,330 --> 00:06:34,483
Now let's add your bank account.

147
00:06:34,483 --> 00:06:36,299
Click Payments on the left.

148
00:06:38,099 --> 00:06:39,582
Under How you get paid,

149
00:06:39,582 --> 00:06:41,838
click Add payment method. In India,

150
00:06:41,838 --> 00:06:44,675
money comes straight into your bank account.

151
00:06:47,275 --> 00:06:49,105
Account holder name —

152
00:06:49,105 --> 00:06:51,110
the same as in AdSense.

153
00:06:51,110 --> 00:06:53,986
Then the bank name and IFSC code,

154
00:06:53,986 --> 00:06:57,298
found on your passbook or cheque book.

155
00:06:58,548 --> 00:07:01,102
Enter the account number twice,

156
00:07:01,102 --> 00:07:02,750
tick Set as primary,

157
00:07:02,750 --> 00:07:03,986
and click Save.

158
00:07:08,286 --> 00:07:08,940
Remember:

159
00:07:08,940 --> 00:07:12,067
the bank account must be in your own name —

160
00:07:12,067 --> 00:07:13,739
the same as in AdSense.

161
00:07:13,739 --> 00:07:16,138
Never use someone else's account.

162
00:07:17,388 --> 00:07:20,122
Money is sent in dollars and arrives in

163
00:07:20,122 --> 00:07:22,225
your bank converted to rupees;

164
00:07:22,225 --> 00:07:24,538
your bank may deduct a small fee.

165
00:07:26,038 --> 00:07:26,478
Next,

166
00:07:26,478 --> 00:07:28,765
the step most people skip:

167
00:07:28,765 --> 00:07:29,821
US tax info.

168
00:07:29,821 --> 00:07:33,779
Earnings from US viewers are taxed in the US.

169
00:07:35,979 --> 00:07:37,226
If it's missing,

170
00:07:37,226 --> 00:07:41,045
up to 24% of your total earnings can be withheld.

171
00:07:41,045 --> 00:07:41,668
With it,

172
00:07:41,668 --> 00:07:44,007
thanks to the India–US treaty,

173
00:07:44,007 --> 00:07:47,202
only US-viewer earnings are taxed at 15%.

174
00:07:48,452 --> 00:07:50,446
Click Add tax info.

175
00:07:50,446 --> 00:07:54,015
Choose Individual, US person: No —

176
00:07:54,015 --> 00:07:56,114
your form is W-8BEN.

177
00:07:57,914 --> 00:08:00,499
Claim treaty benefits for India, Article 12,

178
00:08:00,499 --> 00:08:01,380
enter your PAN,

179
00:08:01,380 --> 00:08:03,201
sign with your name and submit.

180
00:08:07,701 --> 00:08:08,208
Done —

181
00:08:08,208 --> 00:08:11,587
only 15% is now withheld on US earnings.

182
00:08:11,587 --> 00:08:14,629
You can claim it as a credit in your

183
00:08:14,629 --> 00:08:16,234
Indian tax return —

184
00:08:16,234 --> 00:08:17,248
ask your CA.

185
00:08:18,748 --> 00:08:19,787
Now the fun question:

186
00:08:19,787 --> 00:08:20,826
when do you get paid?

187
00:08:20,826 --> 00:08:22,163
At the start of each month,

188
00:08:22,163 --> 00:08:23,944
last month's earnings are finalised.

189
00:08:25,194 --> 00:08:28,115
If your balance is over the payment threshold —

190
00:08:28,115 --> 00:08:28,861
about $100 —

191
00:08:28,861 --> 00:08:29,731
with no holds,

192
00:08:29,731 --> 00:08:32,901
you're paid between the 21st and 26th of the month.

193
00:08:34,151 --> 00:08:35,163
For example:

194
00:08:35,163 --> 00:08:38,619
October's earnings are finalised in early

195
00:08:38,619 --> 00:08:42,918
November and reach your bank around 21–26 November.

196
00:08:44,168 --> 00:08:45,122
Below the threshold?

197
00:08:45,122 --> 00:08:47,317
Your earnings simply roll over to next month —

198
00:08:47,317 --> 00:08:48,081
nothing is lost.

199
00:08:49,581 --> 00:08:51,515
If a payment ever gets stuck,

200
00:08:51,515 --> 00:08:54,584
look for a 'payment hold' message in AdSense —

201
00:08:54,584 --> 00:08:55,984
usually it's the PIN,

202
00:08:55,984 --> 00:08:57,652
tax info or bank details.

203
00:08:59,152 --> 00:08:59,638
Finally,

204
00:08:59,638 --> 00:09:01,944
the mistakes that block payments. One:

205
00:09:01,944 --> 00:09:04,007
creating a second AdSense account.

206
00:09:05,257 --> 00:09:05,550
Two:

207
00:09:05,550 --> 00:09:08,992
different names in AdSense and the bank. Three:

208
00:09:08,992 --> 00:09:10,163
a wrong address,

209
00:09:10,163 --> 00:09:11,994
so the PIN never arrives.

210
00:09:13,244 --> 00:09:13,657
Four:

211
00:09:13,657 --> 00:09:15,145
skipping tax info,

212
00:09:15,145 --> 00:09:17,377
so extra tax gets deducted.

213
00:09:18,877 --> 00:09:20,075
A safety tip:

214
00:09:20,075 --> 00:09:23,854
avoid anyone promising 'AdSense approval'

215
00:09:23,854 --> 00:09:25,789
or fast monetization.

216
00:09:25,789 --> 00:09:29,752
Never share your AdSense or Gmail password.

217
00:09:31,252 --> 00:09:32,217
Quick recap:

218
00:09:32,217 --> 00:09:33,745
eligibility, terms,

219
00:09:33,745 --> 00:09:36,078
AdSense account, review, PIN,

220
00:09:36,078 --> 00:09:38,169
bank account and tax info.

221
00:09:39,419 --> 00:09:41,906
Found this helpful? Like, subscribe,

222
00:09:41,906 --> 00:09:45,361
and ask any question in the comments — I'll reply.

223
00:09:45,361 --> 00:09:47,157
See you in the next video!

